# Input

```css
/* before */ @supports at-rule(foo
bar) { .plain {color:green} }
@supports at-rule(url(\31
x)) /* after query */ { .escaped {color:green} }

```


# Options

```json
{
  "formatter": {
    "lineEnding": "crlf"
  }
}
```

